Markdown in the terminal.
Tables, diagrams and links.

[image: Demo] (docs/demo.gif)

## Usage

Press Ctrl+C to quit. See the guide (docs/guide.md) for
details, and connect with ssh user@.

E = mc2, H2O, bold, italic and code.

▾ Installation from source
  Build it with Go:

  go install github.com/ekalinin/termd/cmd/termd@latest

  ▾ Nested
    A nested details block with a paragraph that is long
    enough to wrap at every width of the golden files.

Key │ Description
────┼────────────
q   │ quit
    │ the pager
/   │ search

